  <ferc:NameOfOfficerWithCustodyOfCorporateBooks id="f-1" contextRef="c-1">Joshua Blakeney</ferc:NameOfOfficerWithCustodyOfCorporateBooks>
  <ferc:TitleOfOfficerWithCustodyOfCorporateBooks id="f-2" contextRef="c-1">Controller</ferc:TitleOfOfficerWithCustodyOfCorporateBooks>
  <ferc:AddressWhereCorporateBooksAreKept id="f-3" contextRef="c-1">10700 Energy Way, Glen Allen, VA 23060</ferc:AddressWhereCorporateBooksAreKept>
  <ferc:StateOfIncorporation id="f-4" contextRef="c-1">DE</ferc:StateOfIncorporation>
  <ferc:IncorporationDate id="f-5" contextRef="c-1">1993-10-28</ferc:IncorporationDate>
  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered id="f-6" contextRef="c-1">Cove Point LNG, LP (Cove Point) is the owner and operator of the Cove Point LNG Facility and the Cove Point Pipeline and the Liquefaction Facility. The Cove Point LNG Facility is a liquified natural gas (LNG) export/import and storage facility located on the Chesapeake Bay in Lusby, Maryland. Cove Point owns approximately 139 miles of interstate natural gas pipeline.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered>
